# Dark Matter Manipulator: "+2/+0 for every seven cards in YOUR graveyard". Turn 1 Bot1 casts one (Mox Jet; mills three), then
# Faithless Looting (a Mox Ruby; draws two, discards two, and itself: six cards in the graveyard, still a 1/2, checked) and a
# Lightning Bolt at Bot2 (a second Ruby): seven cards, so it is a 3/2. On turn 2 Bot2 casts its own Manipulator: it mills three and
# has three cards in its graveyard, so it is a 1/2, whatever Bot1's graveyard holds (Bot1's is 3/2 still).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Dark Matter Manipulator
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x3
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dark Matter Manipulator
Island x20

